  "label": "User projected onto the man in the yellow shirt representing the feeling of being a military spouse over 30",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the man in the yellow shirt (man_in_yellow_shirt), who is depicted with a bored and disengaged expression. This projection is facilitated by the textual material 'how it feels being a military spouse over 30', which directly maps the user's potential identification with that experience onto the man's visual state. The meme format inherently invites the viewer to see themselves in the depicted figure, creating a direct semiotic projection.",
